      693        SIZE 12.63 BY .79
      694        FGCOLOR 0  NO-UNDO.
      695   DEFINE FRAME F-Main
      696        Classify AT ROW 2.71 COL 2.25 NO-LABEL
      697        SortType AT ROW 2.71 COL 35.38 NO-LABEL
